OL,3,GNEWSA'Bike jousting revives the
OL,4,Amedieval spectacle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJousting while riding bikes is
OL,7,F"absolutely a legitimate form" of the
OL,8,Fmedieval sport, a professional jouster
OL,9,Fhas said as details of a second planned
OL,10,Fduel circulate on social media.
OL,12,FJust a few weeks ago, hundreds of
OL,13,Fpeople congregated in London Fields,
OL,14,FHackney, east London, to watch actor
OL,15,FCamtholomew the First and artist Jack
OL,16,FCarden joust while riding Lime bikes.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
