OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1793379371
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Bike jousting revives the
OL,4,Amedieval spectacle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideos on social media showed them
OL,7,Fdressed as knights in armour, complete
OL,8,Fwith chainmail and lances, attempting
OL,9,Fto knock each other off the rentable
OL,10,Fe-bikes. A "rematch" is due to take
OL,11,Fplace on Saturday at a location yet to
OL,12,Fbe disclosed.
OL,14,FLime has been contacted for comment but
OL,15,Fpreviously said its bikes were "not for
OL,16,Fjousting".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
